---
import {expertise} from '../data/site';
---
<section class="section expertise-section" aria-labelledby="expertise-title"><div class="container"><h2 id="expertise-title">Specialist psychiatric opinions.</h2><p class="intro">Independent psychiatric assessments and reports across a range of conditions and legal proceedings.</p><div class="expertise-list">{expertise.map((item,i)=><a class="expertise-item" href={'/'+item.slug}><span class="expertise-number">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.summary}</p><span class="expertise-arrow">Explore this expertise ↗</span></div></a>)}</div><div class="after-expertise"><p>Each proposed instruction is considered individually, with an emphasis on independent, reasoned opinion.</p><a class="text-link" href="/areas-of-expertise">Explore all areas of expertise ↗</a></div></div></section>
